      "content": "idk i'm just kinda scared of doctors and the clinic is always so expensive and the wait times are insane. i feel like i should be able to handle this myself if it's just my body trying to recover. do u think it's possible that i'm just dehydrated or low on electrolytes? like maybe if i just take some extra magnesium or vitamins would that help clear up the chest heaviness and the racing heart?",
