      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but i really just want to try things at home first before i deal with the medical system. it really feels more like just being run down. if i started taking a high dose of magnesium and maybe some ginseng to help with the energy/fatigue, would that be a safe way to see if it's just an imbalance? i feel like if i just rest and get my nutrients back up, it'll go away on its own. like, surely it's not something serious if it's just coming on after a virus?",
